# Local development environment variables — DO NOT COMMIT
#
# In local development the Vite dev server proxies /api → http://localhost:5000
# (configured in vite.config.js), so this variable is NOT required for local dev.
#
# Set VITE_API_URL only when you want to point the frontend at a remote backend,
# for example the Vercel-deployed API.
#
# Example:
# VITE_API_URL=https://roxiler-rating-app-api.vercel.app/api
VITE_API_URL=
